<title>INDIA: Indian October vehicle production rises.</title>
<headline>Indian October vehicle production rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian production of vehicles rose in October compared to same month in 1995, the Association of Indian Automobile Manufacturers (AIAM) said in a monthly report on Saturday.  </p>
<p>AUTOMOBILE PRODUCTION &amp; SALES	  (number of units)</p>
<p>   Category			PRODUCTION</p>
<p>		     Oct 96   Oct 95  Apr-Oct 96  Apr-Oct 95</p>
<p>   TRUCKS	  24,223   19,974    168,604     138,854</p>
<p>   CARS	    28,786   19,570    222,226     181,818</p>
<p>   2-WHEELERS   256,513  206,536  1,778,453   1,468,932</p>
</text>
